@startuml
title Sequence - UC-03 Nhận thông báo tự động
actor "Student App" as StudentApp
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Notification Service" as Notif
participant "Trip & Route Service" as TripSvc
participant "Check-in Service" as Checkin
participant "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "APNS/FCM" as Push
database "DB" as DB

== Đăng ký token thiết bị ==
StudentApp -> API : POST /devices {pushToken}
API -> Notif : register device
Notif -> DB : upsert device token
DB --> Notif : ok
API --> StudentApp : ok

== Nhận thông báo đẩy ==
TripSvc -> Kafka : publish trip ETA soon
Checkin -> Kafka : publish check-in created

Kafka -> Notif : consume events
Notif -> DB : resolve recipients
DB --> Notif : users/devices
Notif -> Push : send notifications
Push --> StudentApp : display notification
@enduml